# C2 allow-list for mlmf-lora. One entry per direct dependency, sorted.
#
# mlmf-core alone (C4): the adapter config is read through `MetadataSource`
# (mlmf-hf-layout's `ConfigJson` is one, a GGUF header another) and the tensor
# list arrives as `TensorDescriptor`s, so no format crate is named.
mlmf-core
